# Retired sitemaps — we collapsed to a single /sitemap.xml.
# Cloudflare Pages' _redirects does NOT support a 404 status, so without these
# the paths fall through to the SPA fallback below and return the homepage HTML
# with a 200 — the worst outcome for a URL Search Console still has on file.
# A 301 to the live sitemap is supported and unambiguous.
/sitemap-static.xml   /sitemap.xml   301
/sitemap-clubs.xml    /sitemap.xml   301

# SPA fallback — all client routes serve index.html
/* /index.html 200
